flowchart LR
    D[DRAFT] --> C[CANDIDATE]
    C --> B[BACKTEST_PASSED]
    B --> W[WALK_FORWARD_PASSED]
    W --> P[PAPER_PASSED]
    P --> S[SHADOW_PASSED]
    S --> A[AWAITING_APPROVAL]
    A -->|Signed human approval| CA[APPROVED_CANARY]
    CA -->|Separate scale approval| PR[PRODUCTION]
    PR --> RT[RETIRED]

    C --> RJ[REJECTED]
    B --> RJ
    W --> RJ
    P --> RJ
    S --> RJ
    CA --> RB[ROLLED_BACK]
    PR --> RB

    AUTO[Automation boundary] -. may advance only to .-> A
